 "notes": "Review paper: every OBS is reproduced from a cited study (attrs.reproduced_from); provenance 'measured' refers to the source study. Graph collapses four case studies (TDI-PAA, HSA@CySCOOH, ICG-peptide, peptide-porphyrin) onto one generic chain; per-case numbers sit in attrs. Lost: D-A cocrystal (DBTTF-TCNB, F9) 300 nm red shift and PPDI-CB[7] antibacterial case (F7), both only as side nodes or dropped; F2 has no caption. Poor fits: r14/r15 intermolecular packing (J-aggregation, pi-stacking, host-guest) typed STR/chemistry/bonding; r24 tumour accumulation (in-vivo biodistribution of the material) typed MEC/pathway. Audit r29: the review's evidence mostly cannot isolate the supramolecular effect from simply delivering a dye."
}